{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"27f42ecd87b37f4c89b009d28de3e8a2459782f1ca686bff6caa6deee09d39c4","ja":"今夜のお仕事は、屋外でのイベント。ミニライブの後に\nトークショーを行うことになっていて……","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2fa89e4e25a5c4796451514da67ed5e7b216804cc48bb50b1dbe5a42a43d46ee","ja":"「ミニライブ、お疲れ様でした！\nトークショーまで、少し休憩していてください！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2c3a68ee121424ab4d6822ba5fcc3ec204b35a984413d13ec058c2015ac80bf5","ja":"ありがとうございます。\nでは、お言葉に甘えさせていただきます。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bcc9729bda06bd7144c5f821b9c3076d686597da4194f34033ee4adff9a0dfa9","ja":"満天の星空の下でのライブ、\nなかなか得難い体験でしたね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d7a958a206f132304e83ce0551f434354de78638a506673d43972c4fdf000b21","ja":"はい。お客さんも楽しそうでよかっ……\n…………ふわぁ～……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e53253bf7e81a97eca9206cd6e141f84e2002b539641e2600879ab925ec75cf3","ja":"あっ……す、すみません～。\n落ち着いたら、急に眠くなってきちゃって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9d046501ed92ab7662b1bebb66a2aea379f054340c31b313b09243d9a1c679b3","ja":"今日は朝からずっと忙しかったもんね。\n私もちょっと、眠たくなってきちゃった……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c5ec7adea52a1925bb43dd2338948510dc44e8805825fe4c98a14aedc39063e2","ja":"ちょっと、シャキッとしなさいよ。\nまだこの後に、トークショーが控えてるんだから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0d0cb3f386584d63670ef79da55821d43104889ab82fb77fdb169c88524579b4","ja":"そ、そうだよね。ごめんごめん。トークショー中に\nうとうとしないように、気をつけなきゃ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"60a0ff5ddd343acc08ccdc5c26ecec5b327b978f39af6e9a48cdef69e2643bd8","ja":"もし眠くなったら、その場で小さく\n足踏みするといいわ。少しは、頭がすっきりするわよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"63f3f8c41008d0948dede18000a3f7ba2a6c1513e97619a1e0e08dadc4e0780d","ja":"そのときは試してみるね。\nあとは……今のうちにガムを噛むとかかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"09e5cdac5c382fcb6d196df758afe521d4d6355304a0160421a405f56493b01a","ja":"スタッフさんから、もらったのがあるよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"bf17657b1d78dc582c95931388c691b3809b8397802b0d2bc6c4dd4ddd25d149","ja":"あ、もらってもいい？\n眠気覚まし、しておかないと……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"5ece02be012de5ae9f7c70d60079405a4a407de492b05e17349252eb402fd17e","ja":"四条さんもいりますか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1487.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"41f36c8921d82d2842d04927aaf8d988def2f3ef6fdb0546cf42ee862b238792","ja":"私は大丈夫です。残すはとーくしょーのみ。\n見事、乗り越えてみせましょう。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
